    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2LSQHQ3UNYALnZhaBNGxSVV)_\n\n`sp-org-tag-lint` and `sp-org-link-conversion` (which `require`s it) failed on init with `void-variable when`.\n\n**Cause:** in `sp-org-tag-lint.el` the last line of the Commentary block (`when \\`sp-org-tag-groups' is loaded.`) had lost its `;; ` prefix, so Emacs read it as code and evaluated `when` as a variable. The literate source `docs/tangles/funct/sp-org-tag-lint.org` already has the comment correctly; only the tangled `.el` was out of step, so no doc change was needed.\n\n**Fix:** restore the `;; ` prefix. CHANGELOG entry added.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container); found by reading the file. Please restart or `M-x load-file` the module to confirm.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8tKzVke4RFNkG2GbW)_",
